bad middle school memories.

00:00:21.318 --> 00:00:22.715
- Well I think this tastes like heaven,

00:00:22.715 --> 00:00:24.869
because Thin Mints are my
favorite Girl Scout Cookies

00:00:24.869 --> 00:00:25.838
of all time.

00:00:25.838 --> 00:00:28.064
- Oh, for days! For fucking days!

00:00:28.064 --> 00:00:28.717
Thin Mints.

00:00:28.717 --> 00:00:32.461
- There's like that minty kick to it.

00:00:32.461 --> 00:00:33.559
(disapproving mumble)

00:00:33.559 --> 00:00:34.151
- No.

00:00:34.151 --> 00:00:34.897
- Nope.

00:00:34.897 --> 00:00:35.999
- The chocolate is more synthetic.

00:00:35.999 --> 00:00:38.227
- This inside is just like chalky.

00:00:38.227 --> 00:00:39.535
- I think this one's a Thin Mint.

00:00:39.535 --> 00:00:40.845
(bell dings)

00:00:40.845 --> 00:00:41.715
(bell dings)
(buzzer)

00:00:41.715 --> 00:00:42.898
What?

00:00:42.898 --> 00:00:43.496
- We're right?

00:00:43.496 --> 00:00:44.322
- I know we're right.

00:00:44.322 --> 00:00:45.196
You don't need to tell me I'm right.

00:00:45.196 --> 00:00:45.886
I know I'm right.

00:00:45.886 --> 00:00:46.446
- We're right.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:48.280
- We're right.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:50.139
- Do they teach you the
correct way to eat a Tagalong

00:00:50.139 --> 00:00:51.096
in the Girl Scouts?

00:00:51.096 --> 00:00:53.155
- The way I ate it was I
ate all the chocolate first,

00:00:53.155 --> 00:00:54.465
and then I would like
the peanut butter out,

00:00:54.465 --> 00:00:55.979
and then I would eat the cookie.

00:00:55.979 --> 00:00:57.308
- There's a good ratio
between the peanut butter

00:00:57.308 --> 00:00:58.362
and chocolate.

00:00:58.362 --> 00:01:00.256
- That's just stale!

00:01:00.256 --> 00:01:01.431
No.

00:01:01.431 --> 00:01:02.605
(questioning expression)

00:01:02.605 --> 00:01:05.581
- The peanut butter is
like a little more chalky,

00:01:05.581 --> 00:01:07.502
whereas this one's creamier.

00:01:07.502 --> 00:01:08.773
- This one's more of a wafer.

00:01:08.773 --> 00:01:09.656
- This one's the Tagalong.

00:01:09.656 --> 00:01:11.056
(bell dings)

00:01:11.056 --> 00:01:12.426
- I'm gonna go with the
dark in the middle too.

00:01:12.426 --> 00:01:14.376
(buzzer)

00:01:14.376 --> 00:01:15.929
- Ooh, by the looks of it,

00:01:15.929 --> 00:01:17.884
they look almost identical.

00:01:17.884 --> 00:01:19.690
I would say that the only thing different

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:22.276
is the darkness in chocolate.

00:01:22.276 --> 00:01:23.331
- That doesn't look good.

00:01:23.331 --> 00:01:25.195
- And the circle, where did the circle go?

00:01:25.195 --> 00:01:27.217
- No merit badge here.

00:01:28.517 --> 00:01:29.358
- Oh!

00:01:29.358 --> 00:01:30.854
- Fuck, that's good too.

00:01:30.854 --> 00:01:32.308
- I like this one a little bit more.

00:01:32.308 --> 00:01:34.185
- You know, I really just
can't tell anything anymore.

00:01:34.185 --> 00:01:36.704
- I wait all year for
the Girl Scout Cookies,

00:01:36.704 --> 00:01:39.412
and now knowing that I
can't tell the difference

00:01:39.412 --> 00:01:40.889
is pretty crushing to me.

00:01:40.889 --> 00:01:41.975
- I think those ones are real too.

00:01:41.975 --> 00:01:42.949
(buzzer)
- What?

00:01:42.949 --> 00:01:43.729
(buzzer)
- What?

00:01:43.729 --> 00:01:44.647
- What?

00:01:44.647 --> 00:01:46.022
- I'm going left!

00:01:46.022 --> 00:01:46.848
- I'm going right.

00:01:46.848 --> 00:01:48.179
(bell dings)
- Damn it!

00:01:48.179 --> 00:01:50.994
My Team Leader would be so pissed at me!

00:01:50.994 --> 00:01:51.995
- This was great!

00:01:51.995 --> 00:01:53.255
- I lost hard.

00:01:53.255 --> 00:01:55.443
- Yeah, I'm surprised that
I got the Samoas wrong.

00:01:55.443 --> 00:01:56.840
- What the fuck are these?

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:58.094
I knew it was Keebler.

00:01:58.094 --> 00:02:01.779
- All the best cookies are
delivered by tiny people.

00:02:02.919 --> 00:02:03.674
- I think after this

00:02:03.674 --> 00:02:06.666
I can say that I will buy any
of the grocery store versions

00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:07.776
besides the Thin Mints.

00:02:07.776 --> 00:02:10.542
- Those fake Tagalongs, those
Fake-alongs, were really good.

00:02:10.542 --> 00:02:13.400
- I feel like I would rather
buy the Girl Scout Cookie,

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:14.965
so I could contribute and be part of this

00:02:14.965 --> 00:02:16.279
really amazing thing

00:02:16.279 --> 00:02:17.993
that has so much history.

00:02:17.993 --> 00:02:20.332
- Now I feel bad.

